# Dev-server mode only (`vite dev`) — never read by `vite build`, so a
# production bundle can never pick up the localhost origin.
#
# Public origin used for the canonical link, og:url and social image URLs.
# Kept on 5173 because `playwright.config.ts` boots its own e2e dev server on
# that port and asserts canonicals match it; `npm run dev` serves on 8080.
VITE_SITE_URL=http://localhost:5173
